#%PAM-1.0
# PAM stack for gma-kiosk.service (PAMName=gma-kiosk), adapted from cage's wiki.
# systemd never asks this stack to authenticate (it only runs pam_setcred,
# the account check and the session), and the kiosk account's password is
# locked, so pam_unix's auth would refuse anyone anyway. pam_systemd registers
# a logind session: XDG_RUNTIME_DIR, seat0 and the user's PipeWire services.
auth      required  pam_unix.so
account   required  pam_unix.so
session   required  pam_loginuid.so
session   required  pam_unix.so
session   required  pam_systemd.so
